1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 21=

15
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,719
A fight for the spirit vein?

16
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,280
Count me in.

17
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:07,280
This...

18
00:01:10,359 --> 00:01:10,760
That's...

19
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,040
That's Zhao Feiyang.

20
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,200
What is he doing here?

21
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:15,239
Perfect timing.

22
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,280
I'll settle the score with him later.

23
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:18,480
Zhao Feiyang,

24
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,000
how dare you!

25
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:22,280
Today is the Martial Arts Tournament
for Southern Domain sects.

26
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:23,280
What's it got to do with you?

27
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:24,120
I remember

28
00:01:24,359 --> 00:01:26,159
he's the chief disciple of your sect.

29
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:26,840
What's going on?

30
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,799
He's left our sect,

31
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,079
no longer one of us.

32
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:31,719
Zhao Feiyang, just leave!

33
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,000
Don't disrupt the tournament!

34
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,640
You're no longer one of us.

35
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:36,159
If you keep causing trouble,

36
00:01:36,599 --> 00:01:38,840
we won't tolerate such insolence!

37
00:01:39,159 --> 00:01:39,719
Do you hear me?

38
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:40,760
Get lost!

39
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:43,680
Or I'll deal with you myself!

40
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,879
Whether I stay or leave

41
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:46,359
is none of your concern.

42
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:47,519
Let me ask you this.

43
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,359
Why have all of you gathered here

44
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,159
for this tournament?

45
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:53,920
In the Southern Domain
of the Shenwu Continent,

46
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:56,200
a high-grade spirit vein has emerged.

47
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:58,319
The Three Great Sects have gathered here

48
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,319
to decide who gets the spirit vein.

49
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,840
Why do you care?

50
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,159
The Southern Domain of Shenwu Continent

51
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,680
has billions of ordinary people

52
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:06,040
and over ten thousand cultivators.

53
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:08,080
Spirit veins are born
of heaven and earth.

54
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,120
How can you decide their fate?

55
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:12,199
They belong to all living beings!

56
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,039
Outrageous!

57
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,280
We're the three top sects
of the Southern Domain.

58
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,319
Can't we decide this

59
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:18,400
on behalf of all?

60
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:22,520
You think you're worthy

61
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:23,879
of speaking for everyone?

62
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,199
(Zhao Feiyang won't listen to reason.)

63
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,479
(He's being this arrogant.)

64
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:34,319
(He's going to offend every sect here.)

65
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,599
Zhao Feiyang, you've gone too far!

66
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:38,680
I advise you to stop making trouble!

67
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:39,520
Elder Murong,

68
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:40,960
I'm not making trouble.

69
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,639
I'm simply stating why I'm here

70
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:45,120
and saying what I need to say.

71
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:45,800
Senior Brother Lin,

72
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:48,240
looks like you won't need
to avenge yourself.

73
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,879
He looks down on everyone.

74
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,840
He deserves to die.

75
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,680
Zhao Feiyang,

76
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,400
is this your way of lashing out

77
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,479
after being kicked out?

78
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,120
Do you think our sect

79
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:00,280
will tolerate your reckless behavior?

80
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,960
This spirit vein belongs
to heaven and earth.

81
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,080
If you can fight for it,

82
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,639
why can't I?

83
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:05,360
You?

84
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:06,599
What do you have to compete with?

85
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,840
On Shenwu Continent, strength is all.

86
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,439
You have no backing.

87
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:12,400
You're just a lone rogue cultivator,

88
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:13,680
with no sect behind you.

89
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,639
You don't even have the right
to compete!

90
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:16,840
Fine.

91
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,439
Since you think
I'm a nobody without a sect,

92
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,919
then I'll announce it right here.

93
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,439
I, Zhao Feiyang,

94
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:26,960
hereby establish the Solitude Sect.

95
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,560
One man, one sword...

96
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:36,639
What...

97
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:38,800
♪My blood runs hot♪

98
00:03:39,112 --> 00:03:41,398
♪I never lose a fight♪

99
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,599
One sect!

100
00:03:42,623 --> 00:03:44,751
♪I rise against the odds♪

101
00:03:44,991 --> 00:03:47,437
♪Who dares stand against me♪

102
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,159
See that?

103
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,759
His sword is no ordinary weapon!

104
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:51,599
But...

105
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,879
why can't I tell what grade it is?

106
00:03:55,439 --> 00:03:56,759
I've seen that robe before.

107
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,000
It's the Heavenly Mystic Robe,

108
00:03:58,159 --> 00:03:59,080
impervious to water and fire.

109
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,759
It's considered
a top-grade magic treasure.

110
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:03,000
He must've gotten lucky this past year

111
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:05,520
and wants to make his name here.

112
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,680
Looks like

113
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,520
he's been hiding his true strength.

114
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,759
With that settled,

115
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:13,080
I'll represent the Solitude Sect
in the tournament.

116
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,680
Does anyone object?

117
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:17,600
Indeed.

118
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,279
Spirit veins are born
of heaven and earth.

119
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,519
They belong to no one.

120
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,759
Anyone can fight for them.

121
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,000
He's right.

122
00:04:23,279 --> 00:04:25,519
I really can't argue with that.

123
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:27,959
There's no rule against starting a sect.

124
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,199
In that case,

125
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:30,519
I have nothing more to say.

126
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,519
Zhao Feiyang,

127
00:04:32,199 --> 00:04:33,800
no wonder you're so confident.

128
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:36,319
So you got two magic treasures.

129
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:38,439
But let me give you some advice.

130
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,800
The gap in cultivation

131
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,519
can't be made up with magic treasures.

132
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,279
If you're making a name for yourself,

133
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:46,879
you've picked the wrong place!

134
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,000
So you're saying

135
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,439
none of you object?

136
00:04:53,079 --> 00:04:53,839
Let's begin.

137
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,000
Zhao Feiyang,

138
00:04:55,319 --> 00:04:56,399
you shouldn't have come here today.

139
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:57,639
Why is that?

140
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,879
Today is when I make my name.

141
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:01,560
And you're nothing but a stepping stone.

142
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,600
Why humiliate yourself

143
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,480
in front of everyone?

144
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,560
So you're saying this is your turf?

145
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:09,879
You seem pretty confident
in your strength.

146
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:11,600
It's not confidence.

147
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,319
It's absolute strength.

148
00:05:15,879 --> 00:05:16,319
Lan,

149
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:17,639
their young sect master

150
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,720
could be trouble.

151
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,439
Let's team up to take her out.

152
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,360
What about Zhao Feiyang?

153
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:22,879
Leave him for now.

154
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:24,399
We can deal with him later.

155
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:25,600
All right.

156
00:05:55,879 --> 00:05:56,680
How can they do that?

157
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,000
Two against one?

158
00:05:58,839 --> 00:05:59,319
That's not fair.

159
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:01,639
Sect Master Qin, Sect Master Liang,

160
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:04,240
you really are in cahoots.

161
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:06,319
The tournament is a free-for-all.

162
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,040
Everyone has their own strategy.

163
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,600
We're not breaking any rules,

164
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,360
are we?

165
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,079
No, you're not.

166
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:15,000
But let me ask you this.

167
00:06:15,879 --> 00:06:17,399
There's only one spirit vein.

168
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:19,040
Even if you win,

169
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,959
who gets the spirit vein?

170
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:22,800
That's none of your concern,
Sect Master Wang.

171
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,879
Qingyun Sect and Tianwu Sect

172
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:27,160
plan to merge after this tournament.

173
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,120
We'll be one sect by then.

174
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,879
What's there to divide?

175
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:34,680
Sect Master Qin and I
are already Dao companions.

176
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:38,279
Our young sect masters
are betrothed too.

177
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,399
We're family now,

178
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:41,360
no boundaries between us.

179
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,040
If you've already merged,

180
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:45,920
only one of you
can enter the tournament.

181
00:06:46,079 --> 00:06:47,240
We haven't merged yet.

182
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,480
(As expected.)

183
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:52,560
(The spiritual energy
on Shenwu Continent)

184
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,040
(is growing scarcer.)

185
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:56,920
(Even the Qingyun and Tianwu Sects
are planning to merge.)

186
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:59,839
(If our sect can't secure
this spirit vein)

187
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:01,319
(and keep living off our reserves,)

188
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:04,839
(we won't be far from closing down.)

189
00:07:05,399 --> 00:07:08,160
(Cuihua, do us proud.)

190
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:11,879
(Show them that our sect is rising.)

191
00:07:37,697 --> 00:07:40,191
(Wu)

192
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,199
Young lady,

193
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,399
you haven't been cultivating for long.

194
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,639
We don't want to bully you.

195
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:47,759
Just surrender.

196
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,079
We're both at Stage 7
of the Spirit Burst Realm.

197
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,000
You're no match for us.

198
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:55,079
Guess I won't beat you two
if I hold back.

199
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,480
In that case,

200
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,720
I'll use half my strength
to play with you.

201
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,560
Half your strength?

202
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:02,639
How arrogant.

203
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,319
Lan, don't hold back.

204
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,680
End this quickly.

205
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,560
All right.

206
00:08:19,536 --> 00:08:20,483
(Minor Perfection Realm, Stage 9)

207
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:30,160
Thousand Miles of Chilling Frost!

208
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:50,879
Good!

209
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:51,440
Good!

210
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,440
The young sect master is incredible!

211
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:53,840
Amazing!

212
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:54,960
Minor Perfection Realm

213
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,240
at her young age?

214
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:57,679
No way...

215
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,320
It's over.

216
00:08:58,879 --> 00:09:00,600
The spirit vein now belongs
to the Heavenly Sword Sect.

217
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,240
I doubt that's all.

218
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,120
With a genius like her,

219
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:06,559
their sect is bound to rise.

220
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,960
My daughter began cultivating
just three years ago,

221
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:11,159
and she's already reached
the Minor Perfection Realm.

222
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:13,360
She'll surely ascend
to immortality one day!

223
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:15,879
(Zhao Feiyang,)

224
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:16,919
(see that?)

225
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,960
(Look at who I am now.)

226
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:20,840
(You must regret it.)

227
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:22,120
Zhao Feiyang,

228
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:24,039
now that you've seen my strength,

229
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:24,960
do you

230
00:09:25,559 --> 00:09:26,519
still have confidence?

231
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:27,799
Why wouldn't I?

232
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,720
You've changed.

233
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,960
You're almost unrecognizable.

234
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,080
The old you wasn't this arrogant

235
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:35,960
or so dismissive of everyone.

236
00:09:36,399 --> 00:09:37,120
But now,

237
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,639
you're totally a clown

238
00:09:39,759 --> 00:09:41,279
who can't even read the situation!

239
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,279
I've changed?

240
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,480
Arrogant?

241
00:09:43,919 --> 00:09:44,799
Dismissive of everyone?

242
00:09:45,159 --> 00:09:45,720
Cuihua,

243
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,879
aren't you describing yourself?

244
00:09:49,639 --> 00:09:50,039
You...!

245
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,559
A smooth path in cultivation

246
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:52,960
isn't always a good thing.

247
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:55,039
For old times' sake,

248
00:09:55,639 --> 00:09:57,320
I'll put a few obstacles in your path.

249
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,320
It may do you some good.

250
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,159
Since it's come to this,

251
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:02,159
there's no friendship

252
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,679
left between you and me.

253
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:04,639
Zhao Feiyang,

254
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:05,840
your era

255
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,919
is over!

256
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:17,039
Why... why isn't he moving?

257
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:19,759
He must've given up resisting.

258
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:23,320
He and Cuihua used to be close.

259
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:25,519
He must be trying to help her

260
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,519
make her victory even more impressive.

261
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:29,679
I see.

262
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,159
Maybe he wants back into the sect

263
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,279
and that's why he's doing this?

264
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,000
Probably.

265
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,399
If he puts on a good show today,

266
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,759
maybe he'll be allowed back

267
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,039
as a servant disciple.

268
00:10:45,483 --> 00:10:48,043
(Great Dao Art)

269
00:11:07,077 --> 00:11:10,707
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

270
00:11:10,864 --> 00:11:13,534
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

271
00:11:13,794 --> 00:11:17,344
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

272
00:11:17,524 --> 00:11:21,724
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

273
00:11:22,174 --> 00:11:25,424
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

274
00:11:25,794 --> 00:11:28,604
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

275
00:11:28,914 --> 00:11:32,294
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

276
00:11:32,424 --> 00:11:36,654
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

277
00:11:37,094 --> 00:11:40,224
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

278
00:11:40,514 --> 00:11:43,594
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

279
00:11:44,164 --> 00:11:47,004
♪With this flesh and soul♪

280
00:11:47,234 --> 00:11:50,254
♪I shall forge a new age♪

281
00:11:50,591 --> 00:11:53,661
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

282
00:11:53,911 --> 00:11:57,001
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

283
00:11:57,221 --> 00:11:59,451
♪At cultivation's peak♪

284
00:11:59,591 --> 00:12:03,431
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

285
00:12:03,841 --> 00:12:06,461
♪The sun and moon turn♪

286
00:12:06,481 --> 00:12:10,151
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

287
00:12:10,611 --> 00:12:17,391
♪I am the undying flame♪

288
00:12:18,071 --> 00:12:22,791
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

289
00:12:23,141 --> 00:12:26,321
♪At last I see, immortality♪

290
00:12:26,481 --> 00:12:31,121
♪Lives in your smiles♪
